---A cargo station is any entity that has the capacity to send cargo units. In Space Age those are [RocketSiloPrototype](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/RocketSiloPrototype.html), [SpacePlatformHubPrototype](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/SpacePlatformHubPrototype.html) and [CargoLandingPadPrototype](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/CargoLandingPadPrototype.html). [Cargo bays](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/prototypes/CargoBayPrototype.html) may provide additional cargo hatches to cargo stations which are cargo bay connectable.
---
---[View Documentation](https://lua-api.factorio.com/latest/types/CargoStationParameters.html)
---@class (exact) CargoStationParameters
---@
